  "changes": [
    "Optional visible screen wake lock during active backups, transfers and longer device queries.",
    "Visibility return reacquires; idle, disconnect and unmount release; stale pending acquisitions are released.",
    "Queued acquisition is skipped if work ends before its microtask starts.",
    "Permission errors and unsupported browsers never gate a transfer; explicit retry after OS release avoids automatic retry loops."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Screen Wake Lock is best effort and does not guarantee Bluetooth in background or after manual screen locking.",
